Subject: [PATCH] fortran: declare the ephemeris SPLIT routine as external

GFortran 16 provides the Fortran 2023 SPLIT intrinsic.  The ephemeris
reader uses a different, local SPLIT subroutine with two arguments.
Declare it external so calls continue to resolve to the existing routine.

--- a/lib/jplsubs.f
+++ b/lib/jplsubs.f
@@ -692 +692,2 @@
-      INTEGER LIST(12),IPT(3,13)
+      INTEGER LIST(12),IPT(3,13)
+      EXTERNAL SPLIT
